  unitName: Anje
  unitId: 10622
  unitNumber: 1023
  description: A female knight from the La Veda Republic who lived before the great
    war against the gods took place. Extremely talented in the art of battle and
    a natural warrior, Anje is said to have been expected to become a great knight.
    Many believe that though she was the silent type, she was kind and loving to
    animals, and a very fervent worshipper of the gods. Anje was last seen offering
    a morning prayer to the gods before she vanished without a trace. Countless knights
    of the kingdom were sent out in search of her, but she was never found.
  summonDesc: I've been summoned...?<br>Nice to meet you...<br>I shall be your lance
    and shield...
  fusionDesc: Thank you...<br>I'm glad to know...<br>That I'm of some use...
